&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong stakeholder management and communication skills, adept at engaging both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;An analytical mindset, capable of utilising data and insights to inform prioritisation and product decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
